KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ default template argument: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
could not be evaluated
--
The constant evaluator does not evaluate a call of a closure's function
call operator: "expected constant expression, but got '(unsigned
int)plus_one(0)'" (also on develop).  In libstdc++ 16, <format>'s
__do_vformat_to loses its body (cpp11_libstdcxx_header_drops/
test_format_typecheck with GCC 16).
